le\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17344375455048_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><div style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:125%; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:125%\"><span style=\"color: #23496d;\"><strong><a href=\"https://events-awards.greenstreet.com/event/infralatam2027/home?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=events-list&amp;utm_campaign=infra_latam_2027&amp;utm_term=infrastructure&amp;utm_content=email-1\" style=\"color:#23496d; font-weight:bold\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"1\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"hAwxkJfw\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #02756e;\">Infra LATAM 2027</span></a></strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:125%\">\n<div style=\"line-height:20px\">(Formerly&nbsp;known as IJ LATAM)</div>\n<div style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"color: #02756e;\"><strong>Save $1,000 with the Super Early Bird Rate</strong></span></div>\n<span style=\"color: #23496d; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"line-height:125%; text-align:center; font-size:14px; font-weight:normal\" align=\"center\">\n<div style=\"line-height:125%\">\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"color: #02756e;\"><a href=\"https://events-awards.greenstreet.com/event/infralatam2027/home?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=events-list&amp;utm_campaign=infra_latam_2027&amp;utm_term=infrastructure&amp;utm_content=email-1\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#00a4bd\" data-hs-link-id=\"2\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"Dxvw6Z4w\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #02756e;\">Infra LATAM 2027</span></strong></a> </span>returns to Miami on <span style=\"color: #02756e;\"><strong>1 - 3 March</strong></span>, bringing together <span style=\"color: #02756e;\"><strong>750+ of the region's leading investors, developers, lenders, sponsors and LPs</strong></span>.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\">Join us in March to discover where capital is being deployed, explore how deals are being executed across LATAM, and connect with the decision-makers financing the region's most significant infrastructure and energy projects.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://events-awards.greenstreet.com/event/infralatam2027/agenda?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=events-list&amp;utm_campaign=infra_latam_2027&amp;utm_term=infrastructure&amp;utm_content=email-1\" style=\"color:#00a4bd; font-weight:bold\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"UFAR6tAU\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #02756e;\">View the agenda and 2027 topics here &gt;&gt;</span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\">Secure your place now&nbsp;and take advantage of our $2,599 Super Early Bird ticket.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"color: #02756e;\">Saving of $1,000! Offer end on November 6.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section_1788526909689\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#ffffff\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\">\n    \n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n      <table align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentati